msgid "<span class=\"dashicons dashicons-yes\"></span>The display_errors is Off."
msgstr "<span class=\"dashicons dashicons-yes\"></span>display_errors è Off."

#: include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_php_expose.php:32
msgid "When the expose_php directive is enabled, PHP includes critical pieces of information within the HTTP response X-Powered-By header when a page is requested."
msgstr "Quando la direttiva expose_php è abilitata, PHP include informazioni critiche all'interno dell'header X-Powered-By della risposta HTTP quando una pagina viene richiesta."

#: include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_php_expose.php:48
msgid ""
"<span class=\"dashicons dashicons-no\"></span>The expose_php is ON. \n"
"                                                                        To fix this security issue, change the php.ini:\n"
"\n"
"                                                                        <br /><code>expose_php = \"off\"</code>\n"
"\n"
"                                                                        <br />or within .htaccess:\n"
"\n"
"                                                                        <br /><code>php_flag expose_php off</code>."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"dashicons dashicons-no\"></span>expose_php è ON.\n"
"Per risolvere questo problema di sicurezza, cambia il php.ini:\n"
"<br /><code>expose_php = \"off\"</code>\n"
"<br />o all'interno di .htaccess:\n"
"<br /><code>php_flag expose_php off</code>."

