msgstr "<span class=\"dashicons dashicons-yes\"></span>expose_php è Off."

#: include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_php_register_globals.php:32
msgid "When register_globals is enabled, PHP will automatically create variables in the global scope for any value passed in GET, POST or COOKIE. This, combined with the use of variables without initialization, has led to numerous security vulnerabilities."
msgstr "Quando register_globals è abilitato, PHP creerà automaticamente variabili nell'ambito globale per qualsiasi valore passato in GET, POST o COOKIE. Questo, combinato con l'uso di variabili senza inizializzazione, ha portato a numerose vulnerabilità di sicurezza."

#: include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_php_register_globals.php:48
msgid ""
"<span class=\"dashicons dashicons-no\"></span>The register_globals is ON. \n"
"                                                                        To fix this security issue, change the php.ini:\n"
"\n"
"                                                                        <br /><code>register_globals = \"off\"</code>\n"
"\n"
"                                                                        <br />or within .htaccess:\n"
"\n"
"                                                                        <br /><code>php_flag register_globals off</code>."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"dashicons dashicons-no\"></span>register_globals è ON.\n"
"Per risolvere questo problema di sicurezza, cambia il php.ini:\n"
"<br /><code>register_globals = \"off\"</code>\n"
"<br />o all'interno di .htaccess:\n"
"<br /><code>php_flag register_globals off</code>."

#: include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_php_register_globals.php:64
msgid "<span class=\"dashicons dashicons-yes\"></span>The register_globals is Off."
msgstr "<span class=\"dashicons dashicons-yes\"></span>register_globals è Off."

#: include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_php_safe_mode.php:32
msgid "The PHP safe mode is an attempt to solve the shared-server security problem. It is architecturally incorrect to try to solve this problem at the PHP level, but since the alternatives at the web server and OS levels aren't very realistic, many people, especially ISP's, use safe mode for now."
msgstr ""
"La safe mode di PHP è un tentativo di risolvere il problema di sicurezza del server condiviso. È architetturalmente scorretto tentare di risolvere questo problema a livello PHP, ma poiché le alternative a livello server web e SO non sono molto realistiche, molte persone, specialmente gli ISP, "
"utilizzano la safe mode per ora."

#: include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_php_safe_mode.php:48
msgid ""
"<span class=\"dashicons dashicons-no\"></span>The register_globals is ON. \n"
"                                                                        To fix this security issue, change the php.ini:\n"
"\n"
"                                                                        <br /><code>safe_mode = \"off\"</code>\n"
"\n"
"                                                                        <br />or within .htaccess:\n"
"\n"
"                                                                        <br /><code>php_flag safe_mode off</code>."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"dashicons dashicons-no\"></span>register_globals è ON.\n"
"Per risolvere questo problema di sicurezza, cambia il php.ini:\n"
"<br /><code>safe_mode = \"off\"</code>\n"
"<br />o all'interno di .htaccess:\n"
"<br /><code>php_flag safe_mode off</code>."

#: include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_php_safe_mode.php:64
msgid "<span class=\"dashicons dashicons-yes\"></span>The safe_mode is Off."
msgstr "<span class=\"dashicons dashicons-yes\"></span>safe_mode è Off."

