"When the PostProcessing function is active, the plugin core applies the Replacements for all page elements including assets, before the HTML content is sent back to the browser. Rarely, some JavaScripts load additional assets, once the DOM document has loaded. In such a case, a Replacement filter "
"is not possible as the browser loads the content directly through the file link. "
