#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:46 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:49
msgid "Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only"
msgstr "Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only"

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:50
msgid "The HTTP Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only response header allows web developers to experiment with Content-Security-Policy policies by monitoring (but not enforcing) their effects. These violation reports consist of JSON documents sent via an HTTP POST request to the specified URI."
msgstr ""
"L'header di risposta HTTP Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only permette agli sviluppatori web di sperimentare con le politiche Content-Security-Policy monitorandone (ma non imponendone) gli effetti. Questi report di violazione consistono in documenti JSON inviati tramite una richiesta HTTP POST "
"all'URI specificato."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:52 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:53 modules/components/security-header-permissions-policy.php:52
msgid "Directives:"
msgstr "Direttive:"

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:53 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:54
msgid "Serves as a fallback for the other fetch directives.."
msgstr "Funge da fallback per le altre direttive di fetch."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:54 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:55
msgid "Defines the valid sources for web workers and nested browsing contexts loaded using elements such as &#60;frame&#62; and &#60;iframe&#62;."
msgstr "Definisce le fonti valide per i web worker e i contesti di navigazione nidificati caricati utilizzando elementi come &#60;frame&#62; e &#60;iframe&#62;."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:55 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:56
msgid "Restricts the URLs which can be loaded using script interfaces."
msgstr "Limita gli URL che possono essere caricati utilizzando interfacce script."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:56 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:57
msgid "Specifies valid sources for fonts loaded using @font-face."
msgstr "Specifica le fonti valide per i font caricati utilizzando @font-face."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:57 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:62 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:58 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:63
msgid "Specifies valid sources for nested browsing contexts loading using elements such as &#60;frame&#62; and &#60;iframe&#62;."
msgstr "Specifica le fonti valide per il caricamento dei contesti di navigazione nidificati utilizzando elementi come &#60;frame&#62; e &#60;iframe&#62;."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:58 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:59
msgid "Specifies valid sources of images and favicons.."
msgstr "Specifica le fonti valide di immagini e favicon."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:59 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:60
msgid "Specifies valid sources of application manifest files."
msgstr "Specifica le fonti valide dei file manifest dell'applicazione."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:60 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:61
msgid "Specifies valid sources for loading media using the &#60;audio&#62; , &#60;video&#62; and &#60;track&#62; elements."
msgstr "Specifica le fonti valide per il caricamento dei media utilizzando gli elementi &#60;audio&#62;, &#60;video&#62; e &#60;track&#62;."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:61 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:62
msgid "Specifies valid sources for the &#60;object&#62;, &#60;embed&#62;, and &#60;applet&#62; elements."
msgstr "Specifica le fonti valide per gli elementi &#60;object&#62;, &#60;embed&#62; e &#60;applet&#62;."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:63 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:64
msgid "Specifies valid sources for JavaScript."
msgstr "Specifica le fonti valide per JavaScript."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:64 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:65
msgid "Specifies valid sources for JavaScript &#60;script&#62; elements."
msgstr "Specifica le fonti valide per gli elementi JavaScript &#60;script&#62;."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:65 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:66
msgid "Specifies valid sources for JavaScript inline event handlers."
msgstr "Specifica le fonti valide per i gestori di eventi inline JavaScript."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:66 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:67
msgid "Specifies valid sources for stylesheets."
msgstr "Specifica le fonti valide per i fogli di stile."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:67 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:68
msgid "Specifies valid sources for stylesheets &#60;style&#62; elements and &#60;link&#62; elements with rel='stylesheet'. "
msgstr "Specifica le fonti valide per gli elementi fogli di stile &#60;style&#62; e gli elementi &#60;link&#62; con rel='stylesheet'."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:68 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:69
msgid "Specifies valid sources for inline styles applied to individual DOM elements."
msgstr "Specifica le fonti valide per gli stili inline applicati a singoli elementi DOM."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:69 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:70
msgid "Specifies valid sources for Worker, SharedWorker, or ServiceWorker scripts."
msgstr "Specifica le fonti valide per gli script Worker, SharedWorker o ServiceWorker."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:70 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:71
msgid "Restricts the URLs which can be used in a document's &#60;base&#62; element. "
msgstr "Limita gli URL che possono essere utilizzati nell'elemento &#60;base&#62; di un documento."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:71 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:72
msgid "Enables a sandbox for the requested resource similar to the &#60;iframe&#62; sandbox attribute."
msgstr "Abilita una sandbox per la risorsa richiesta simile all'attributo sandbox di &#60;iframe&#62;."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:72 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:73
msgid "Restricts the URLs which can be used as the target of a form submissions from a given context."
msgstr "Limita gli URL che possono essere utilizzati come destinazione per l'invio di moduli da un determinato contesto."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:73 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:74
msgid "Specifies valid parents that may embed a page using &#60;frame&#62;, &#60;iframe&#62;, &#60;object&#62;, &#60;embed&#62;, or &#60;applet&#62;. "
msgstr "Specifica i genitori validi che possono incorporare una pagina utilizzando &#60;frame&#62;, &#60;iframe&#62;, &#60;object&#62;, &#60;embed&#62; o &#60;applet&#62;."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:74 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:75
msgid "Restricts the URLs to which a document can initiate navigation by any means, including &#60;form&#62; (if form-action is not specified), &#60;a&#62;, window.location, window.open, etc."
msgstr "Limita gli URL verso i quali un documento può avviare la navigazione con qualsiasi mezzo, incluso &#60;form&#62; (se form-action non è specificato), &#60;a&#62;, window.location, window.open, ecc."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:75 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:76
msgid "The directive instructs the user agent to report attempts to violate the Content Security Policy. These violation reports consist of JSON documents sent via an HTTP POST request to the specified URI."
msgstr "La direttiva istruisce l'user agent a segnalare i tentativi di violazione della Content Security Policy. Questi report di violazione consistono in documenti JSON inviati tramite una richiesta HTTP POST all'URI specificato."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:76 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:77
msgid "Fires a SecurityPolicyViolationEvent. These violation reports consist of JSON documents sent via an HTTP POST request to the specified URI."
msgstr "Genera un SecurityPolicyViolationEvent. Questi report di violazione consistono in documenti JSON inviati tramite una richiesta HTTP POST all'URI specificato."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:77 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:78
msgid "Requires the use of SRI for scripts or styles on the page."
msgstr "Richiede l'uso di SRI per script o stili sulla pagina."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:78 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:79
msgid "Enforces Trusted Types at the DOM XSS injection sinks."
msgstr "Impone Trusted Types ai sink di iniezione DOM XSS."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:79 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:80
msgid "Used to specify an allow-list of Trusted Types policies. Trusted Types allows applications to lock down DOM XSS injection sinks to only accept non-spoofable, typed values in place of strings."
msgstr "Utilizzato per specificare un allow-list delle politiche Trusted Types. Trusted Types permette alle applicazioni di bloccare i sink di iniezione DOM XSS per accettare solo valori tipizzati non falsificabili al posto di stringhe."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:80 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:81
msgid "Instructs user agents to treat all of a site's insecure URLs (those served over HTTP) as though they have been replaced with secure URLs (those served over HTTPS). This directive is intended for web sites with large numbers of insecure legacy URLs that need to be rewritten."
msgstr "Istuisce gli user agent a trattare tutti gli URL non sicuri di un sito (quelli serviti tramite HTTP) come se fossero stati sostituiti con URL sicuri (quelli serviti tramite HTTPS). Questa direttiva è destinata a siti web con un gran numero di URL legacy non sicuri che devono essere riscritti."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:82 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:83
msgid "Values:"
msgstr "Valori:"

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:83 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:84
msgid "Won't allow loading of any resources."
msgstr "Non permetterà il caricamento di alcuna risorsa."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:84 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:85
msgid "Only allow resources from the current origin."
msgstr "Permette solo risorse dalla stessa origine."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:85 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:86
msgid "The trust granted to a script in the page due to an accompanying nonce or hash is extended to the scripts it loads."
msgstr "La fiducia concessa a uno script nella pagina a causa di un nonce o hash associato si estende agli script che carica."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:86 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:87
msgid "Require a sample of the violating code to be included in the violation report."
msgstr "Richiede che un campione del codice violante sia incluso nel report di violazione."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:87 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:88
msgid "Allow use of inline resources."
msgstr "Permette l'uso di risorse inline."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:88 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:89
msgid "Allow use of dynamic code evaluation such as eval, setImmediate , and window.execScript."
msgstr "Permette l'uso della valutazione dinamica del codice come eval, setImmediate e window.execScript."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:89 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:90
msgid "Only allow loading of resources from a specific host, with optional scheme, port, and path. e.g. example.com, *.example.com, https://*.example.com:12/path/to/file.js."
msgstr "Permette solo il caricamento di risorse da un host specifico, con schema, porta e percorso opzionali. es. example.com, *.example.com, https://*.example.com:12/path/to/file.js."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:90 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:91
msgid "Path parts in the CSP that end in / match any path they are a prefix of. e.g. example.com/api/ will match URLs like example.com/api/users/new."
msgstr "Le parti del percorso nel CSP che terminano con / corrispondono a qualsiasi percorso di cui sono un prefisso. es. example.com/api/ corrisponderà a URL come example.com/api/users/new."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:91 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:92
msgid "Other path parts in the CSP are matched exactly e.g. example.com/file.js will match http://example.com/file.js and https://example.com/file.js, but not https://example.com/file.js/file2.js."
msgstr "Altre parti del percorso nel CSP sono corrisposte esattamente, es. example.com/file.js corrisponderà a http://example.com/file.js e https://example.com/file.js, ma non a https://example.com/file.js/file2.js."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:92 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:93
msgid "Only allow loading of resources over a specific scheme e.g. https:, http:, data:, mediastream:, blob:, filesystem:"
msgstr "Permette solo il caricamento di risorse tramite uno schema specifico, es. https:, http:, data:, mediastream:, blob:, filesystem:"

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:93 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:94
msgid "Alternatively, a JavaScript hash can be used instead.  The CSP Level 2 specification allows to compute the SHA-256 / sha384 / sha512 for the inline JavaScript code."
msgstr "In alternativa, può essere utilizzato un hash JavaScript. La specifica CSP Level 2 permette di calcolare SHA-256 / sha384 / sha512 per il codice JavaScript inline."

